        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCCOVCOM, Arc Single Cylinder Entryset with Black Glass Coventry Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arc Entryset with Coventry Knob has a classy retro feel that looks as if it would be right at home in any historic building. It has an understated beauty. The Arc Single Cylinder Entryset with Black Glass Coventry Knob is operated by a thumbturn from the interior and a key from the exterior. Choose from a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCCOVCOM Single Cylinder Arc Entryset with Black Glass Knob:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arc Rosette with Coventry Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Rose Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Rose Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Deadbolt Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Deadbolt Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCCOV-specifications.pdf?v=1704262365\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCCOVCOM Entryset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
